/**
 * Today's Bikram Sambat (Nepali) date.
 * BS month lengths aren't formulaic, so they come from a table; we count days forward
 * from a known anchor: 1976-04-13 AD = 2033 Baishakh 1 BS. Covers 2033–2101 BS.
 */
